{"unit_id": "tag:0B5I:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为分次环（graded ring）。令<MATH_0002>。\n设<MATH_0003>为拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的<MATH_0004>-模（module）。\n将<MATH_0005>定义为分次（graded）<MATH_0006>-模（module），这里用到\n（<REF_0001>）和（<REF_0002>）。\n则存在一个典范（canonical）的<MATH_0007>-模同态（module map）\n<MATH_0008>，\n它对<MATH_0009>具有函子性（functorial），且诱导映射（induced map）\n<MATH_0010>是恒等映射（identity）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "module map", "target_term": "模同态"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性"}, {"source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射"}, {"source_term": "identity", "target_term": "恒等映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环", "context": "指引理开头给定的环。"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚", "context": "限定所给的模。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指假设中给定的拟凝聚模。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "限定利用所引两式定义的模。"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "指利用所引两式定义的分次模。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "限定引理断言存在的模同态。"}, {"source_term": "module map", "target_term": "模同态", "context": "指引理断言存在的映射。"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性", "context": "描述该模同态对所指定对象的依赖。"}, {"source_term": "induced map", "target_term": "诱导映射", "context": "指由该模同态诱导、在结论中指定的映射。"}, {"source_term": "identity", "target_term": "恒等映射", "context": "指诱导映射等于相应对象的恒等映射。"}], "notes": []}
